<p>The profile must be public (Instagram: Settings → Account privacy off; TikTok: Privacy → Private account off; Telegram: channel set to "public" with a t.me link; X: "Protect your posts" off). Do not change your username while the order runs; the link becomes invalid and delivery stops. For like orders the post must not have like and comment counts hidden.</p>
