<blockquote>Honest warning: password-free ordering protects your account security but does not change platform rules; if artificial engagement is detected your count can drop. Use moderately and gradually; see the <a href="/blog/takipci-satin-almak-guvenli-mi">safe buying rules</a>.</blockquote>
